# System default (/etc/xdg/powerdevilrc); a user's ~/.config/powerdevilrc still wins.
# PowerButtonAction=1 is Sleep; Plasma 6 reads only this capitalised key (lowercase is the
# Plasma 5 name it migrates from). powerdevil inhibits logind's power-key handling while the
# session runs, so it must suspend itself; Plasma Mobile's default only toggles the screen.
[AC][SuspendAndShutdown]
PowerButtonAction=1

[Battery][SuspendAndShutdown]
PowerButtonAction=1

[LowBattery][SuspendAndShutdown]
PowerButtonAction=1
